,"Reset button look",7,21,0},{"r","Reset notice look",7,21,0},{"d","Reset notice look",7,21,0,"Fonts, colours, sizes and animations go back to how Readycheck ships. Your sets, buttons and positions stay."},{"r","Settings",8,0,0},{"r","Spec",8,0,0},{"r","Sets",8,0,0},{"r","Dockable & Macros",8,0,0},{"c","Create new set",8,22,0},{"r","Name:",8,22,0},{"r","Icon:",8,22,0},{"r","Create Empty",8,22,0},{"r","From Current Gear",8,22,0},{"c","Saved gear sets",8,23,0},{"r","No gear sets saved yet. Create one above!",8,23,0},{"r","Settings",9,0,0},{"r","Spec",9,0,0},{"r","Sets",9,0,0},{"r","Dockable & Macros",9,0,0},{"c","Gear by spec",9,24,0},{"r","Use my spec for my gear",9,24,0},{"d","Use my spec for my gear",9,24,0,"Off: every menu lists everything and nothing is put on by itself. Turn it on to say which specs each gear set and item is for, so the dockable buttons' menus only list what fits what you are doing - and, if you want, to have a set go on by itself."},{"r","Settings",10,0,0},{"r","Spec",10,0,0},{"r","Sets",10,0,0},{"r","Dockable & Macros",10,0,0},{"c","Dockable buttons",10,2,0},{"d","Dockable buttons",10,2,0,"Floating gear icons you can place anywhere on screen. Hover one to see every item you own for that slot and click to equip. Great for one-click trinket and weapon swaps."},{"r","- create or remove a dockable button",10,2,0},{"r","Alt+Click a slot on your character sheet",10,2,0},{"r","- move it anywhere, or dock it onto another UI frame",10,2,0},{"r","Drag a dockable button",10,2,0},{"r","- shows a menu of items you can equip in that slot",10,2,0},{"r","Hover a dockable button",10,2,0},{"r","- same menu directly on the character pane (toggle above)",10,2,0},{"r","Alt+Hover a character sheet slot",10,2,0},{"r","- stops accidental drags and hides the remove button",10,2,0},{"r","Lock Dockable Buttons",10,2,0},{"c","Hidden in hover menus",10,25,0},{"d","Hidden in hover menus",10,25,0,"Hide: Ctrl+Right-click an item or set in a dockable button's hover menu. Show again: hold Shift over the menu so hidden ones show faded, then Ctrl+Shift+Right-click the one you want back - or untick it below. Copies with a different enchant are separate, so you can hide the plain pair and keep the enchanted one. Character sheet menus and the set editor always show everything."},{"r","Hold to show hidden entries",10,25,0},{"r","Shift",10,25,0},{"r","Hidden right now",10,25,0},{"r","Nothing is hidden.",10,25,0},{"r","Menu",10,25,0},{"r","Show everything again",10,25,0},{"r","Gear Sets",10,25,0},{"r","No gear sets yet.",10,25,0},{"c","Macros & keybinds",10,26,0},{"d","Macros & keybinds",10,26,0,"Click inside the box below to select all commands, then Ctrl+C to copy. Paste any line into a /macro, drag the macro to your action bar, and bind the slot to a key. Works in combat - the swap queues and applies the moment combat ends."}},f={"gear_manager|card|visibility|Gear buttons fade and opacity","gear_manager|card|visibility|Swap notice fade and opacity","gear_manager|card|chrome|Gear buttons edge and shadow","gear_manager|card|chrome|Swap notice edge and shadow","gear_manager|text|gmName|Name position","gear_manager|text|gmTimer|Timer","gear_manager|text|toasttitle|Title","gear_manager|text|toastnames|Piece names","gear_manager|text|toastcontext|Reason line","gear_manager|card|framePos|Gear buttons layer","gear_manager|card|framePos|Swap notice layer"},p={["behavior,look,text,animation,sound,position,advanced=advanced;settings,sets,auto,dockable=settings"]={{key="settings",label="Settings",many=true,sig="settings,sets,auto,dockable"},{key="advanced",label="Advanced",many=true,sig="behavior,look,text,animation,sound,position,advanced"}},["behavior,look,text,animation,sound,position,advanced=animation;settings,sets,auto,dockable=settings"]={{key="settings",label="Settings",many=true,sig="settings,sets,auto,dockable"},{key="animation",label="Animation",many=true,sig="behavior,look,text,animation,sound,position,advanced"}},["behavior,look,text,animati