[=[return {c={"Boss debuff tracker","Show in","Fade and opacity","Warnings","Whisper reminders","Tracked auras","Appearance","Row order","Frame edge and shadow","Look per state","Text","Text and part positions","Urgent sound","Animation","Position","Frame layer and scale"},e={{"c","Boss debuff tracker",1,1,0},{"r","Enable Boss Debuff Tracker",1,1,0},{"d","Enable Boss Debuff Tracker",1,1,0,"Watches Sunder, the curses, Scorch stacks, Demo Shout and the rest on your target, lists time left and stacks, and calls out anything about to drop or already missing. Timers for other people's debuffs are estimated from when they were applied."},{"t","Alerts:",1,1,0,"Voice + On-screen Show the timer list and speak the warnings. Voice only No frame on screen; only the spoken warnings. On-screen only Just the timer list, never speaks."},{"r","Alerts:",1,1,0},{"r","Voice + On-screen",1,1,0},{"d","Voice + On-screen",1,1,0,"Voice alerts also need 'Enable voice alerts (TTS)' switched on under Reminder Settings > Sound."},{"t","On screen:",1,1,0,"All Debuffs on the target with time left, plus every tracked debuff that is missing. Active only Only debuffs that are on the target, with time left. Missing only Hides a debuff while the target has it, so the list is only what needs putting up."},{"r","On screen:",1,1,0},{"r","All",1,1,0},{"c","Show in",1,2,0},{"t","Bosses only",1,2,0,"Bosses only Only track raid bosses and their named adds. Off = any attackable target."},{"t","Only in combat",1,2,0,"Only in combat Hides the list and stays quiet out of combat."},{"r","Hyjal Summit",1,2,0},{"r","Tempest Keep",1,2,0},{"r","Black Temple",1,2,0},{"r","Zul'Aman",1,2,0},{"r","Sunwell Plateau",1,2,0},{"r","Serpentshrine Cavern",1,2,0},{"r","Only in combat",1,2,0},{"r","Bosses only",1,2,0},{"r","Magtheridon's Lair",1,2,0},{"r","Karazhan",1,2,0},{"r","Gruul's Lair",1,2,0},{"t","Show in:",1,2,0,"Always Shown everywhere, whenever the bar is enabled. In a Group Only while you are in a party or raid group, anywhere in the world. In Cities Only while you are resting - inside an inn or a capital city. In Raids Only while you are inside a raid instance. Being in a raid group outside an instance does not count. Raids & Cities Inside a raid instance, or while resting in an inn or a capital city."},{"r","In Raids",1,2,0},{"r","Show in:",1,2,0},{"d","Show in:",1,2,0,"Group = in any party or raid, anywhere. Raids = inside a raid instance. Cities = resting in an inn or capital city."},{"r","All",1,2,0},{"r","Which raids count (none ticked = all raids)",1,2,0},{"r","None",1,2,0},{"c","Fade and opacity",1,3,0},{"r","When it shows, opacity, mouseover, fades",1,3,0},{"r","Show",1,3,1},{"r","Opacity",1,3,1},{"r","Default",1,3,1},{"r","Opacity in combat",1,3,1},{"r","Brighten on mouseover",1,3,1},{"r","Opacity on mouseover",1,3,1},{"r","Fade in",1,3,1},{"r","0.20s",1,3,1},{"r","Fade out",1,3,1},{"r","0.30s",1,3,1},{"d","0.30s",1,3,0,"On top of its own show rules above: a rule that is not met fades it out."},{"c","Warnings",1,4,0},{"t","Say when missing",1,4,0,"Say when missing Speaks '<debuff> missing' when a tracked debuff falls off the target mid-fight, and repeats it on the interval below while it stays off."},{"r","Say when missing",1,4,0},{"r","First warning at:",1,4,0},{"r","10s",1,4,0},{"r","Urgent warning at:",1,4,0},{"r","3s",1,4,0},{"r","Repeat every:",1,4,0},{"r","20s",1,4,0},{"r","Test voice",1,4,0},{"c","Whisper reminders",1,5,0},{"t","Whisper the caster when it runs out",1,5,0,"Whisper the caster when it runs out Only people in your group - never yourself, never anyone dead or offline. Everything owed to one person goes in a single whisper."},{"r","Whisper the caster when it runs out",1,5,0},{"d","Whisper the caster when it runs out",1,5,0,"When a debuff drops off the boss and is not back a few seconds later, whoever put it up gets one whisper: 'Faerie Fire has dropped off Patchwerk'. Sunder, Scorch and the other stacking or rotation debuffs are never whispered about."},{"c","Tracked auras",1,6,0},{"d","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Click a debuff to track it. Rows keep this order on screen, so raid leads can read them by position."},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Hunter's Mark Hunter's Mark 120s when someone else applies it Not tracked - click to track"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Nightfall Spell Vulnerability 5s when someone else applies it Tracked - click to stop"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Improved Shadow Bolt Shadow Vulnerability 12s when someone else applies it, shows stacks Not tracked - click to track"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Shadow Weaving Shadow Weaving 15s when someone else applies it, shows stacks Tracked - click to stop"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Judgement of Wisdom Judgement of Wisdom 10s when someone else applies it Tracked - click to stop"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Judgement of the Crusader Judgement of the Crusader 10s when someone else applies it Not tracked - click to track"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Judgement of Light Judgement of Light 10s when someone else applies it Not tracked - click to track"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Annihilator Annihilator 45s when someone else applies it, shows stacks Not tracked - click to track"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Gift of Arthas Gift of Arthas 180s when someone else applies it Not tracked - click to track"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Ignite Ignite 4s when someone else applies it, shows stacks Not tracked - click to track"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Winter's Chill Winter's Chill 15s when someone else applies it, shows stacks Tracked - click to stop"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Thunder Clap Thunder Clap 30s when someone else applies it Tracked - click to stop"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Curse of Recklessness Curse of Recklessness 120s when someone else applies it Tracked - click to stop"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Expose Armor Expose Armor 30s when someone else applies it Not tracked - click to track"},{"t","Tracked auras",1,6,0,"Sunder Armor Sunder Armor 3