[=[return {c={"Raid buff tracker","Show in","Fade and opacity","Warnings","Whisper reminders","Tracked auras","Appearance","Row order","Frame edge and shadow","Look per state","Text","Text and part positions","Urgent sound","Animation","Position","Frame layer and scale"},e={{"c","Raid buff tracker",1,1,0},{"r","Enable Raid Buff Tracker",1,1,0},{"d","Enable Raid Buff Tracker",1,1,0,"Watches Fortitude, Intellect, Mark of the Wild, the Blessings and the rest on you, lists how long each has left and warns before they run out."},{"t","Alerts:",1,1,0,"Voice + On-screen Show the timer list and speak the warnings. Voice only No frame on screen; only the spoken warnings. On-screen only Just the timer list, never speaks."},{"r","Alerts:",1,1,0},{"r","Voice + On-screen",1,1,0},{"d","Voice + On-screen",1,1,0,"Voice alerts also need 'Enable voice alerts (TTS)' switched on under Reminder Settings > Sound."},{"t","On screen:",1,1,0,"All Buffs you have with time left, plus every tracked buff you are missing. Active only Only buffs you have, with time left. Missing only Hides a buff while you have it, so the list is only what you still need."},{"r","On screen:",1,1,0},{"r","Active only",1,1,0},{"c","Show in",1,2,0},{"t","Only in combat",1,2,0,"Only in combat Hides the list and stays quiet out of combat."},{"r","Only in combat",1,2,0},{"t","Show in:",1,2,0,"Always Shown everywhere, whenever the bar is enabled. In a Group Only while you are in a party or raid group, anywhere in the world. In Cities Only while you are resting - inside an inn or a capital city. In Raids Only while you are inside a raid instance. Being in a raid group outside an instance does not count. Raids & Cities Inside a raid instance, or while resting in an inn or a capital city."},{"r","In Raids",1,2,0},{"r","Show in:",1,2,0},{"d","Show in:",1,2,0,"Group = in any party or raid, anywhere. Raids = inside a raid instance. Cities = resting in an inn or capital city."},{"c","Fade and opacity",1,3,0},{"r","When it show